{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の陽気が待ち遠しい今日この頃、いかがお過ごしですか？北野日奈子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！48回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n棚からよもぎ餅さんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"75パーセントひなペン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンギンの鳴き声"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で何度かやったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手だよね♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンギン最近すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から撮影で\n夕方からさっきまで\n14枚目のアンダー楽曲の振り入れをしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽曲もダンスも楽しみにしていて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、いまは\nひめちゃんのお家にお泊りにきてるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話してたりブログ書く前に\nお風呂を済ませちゃおうと思ってたら\nもう時間がなくなっちゃいました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！今日のその朝からの撮影はね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月24日発売の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.さんの4月号の\nグラビア撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生アンダーメンバーでの撮影で\nわいわいと楽しい撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、オフショットとたくさんあるので\n発売されたら載せていきます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  匿名さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんお疲れ様＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎お疲れ様です！ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(25)ダダダダーンさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎やっほー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎やっほー！やっほー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  カイさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃちゃん、おはよー。１４枚目個握完売数増えたね。良かったよ。また寒い日があるらしいけど体調崩さないように気をつけてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありがとうございます！皆さんが会いに来てくださるのすごく楽しみにしています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも、体調には気をつけてください( ºΔº )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  のぞみ。さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんは普段、髪のケアはなにしてる？最近ボブにして何をしようかな～とおもってるから教えてくれたら嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎特に何もしてないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型をおしえて～！ってことかな？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボブは、あんまりアレンジなさそうにみえて\n結構あるから楽しめますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的には、ボブで派手にするなら\nコテで巻き巻きにするより\nアイロンでウェーブにするほうが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  てるるさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎俺、ヨッシーの被り物持ってるんだけど、\n名古屋と京都いけないんだー......\n悔しいたけ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎あらら。。。残念です。。。ヨッシーだったら仲間にしたのに！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もヒナセレやります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、前々回？\nいや、前々そのまた前回？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のヒナセレがまだまとめきれてないので\n明日必ずのせます。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おそくなってごめんね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、あしたは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！もやります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/06/8440942/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n41回目は赤坂みっけさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラはきっかけなんだ"}],"source":"archive"}